{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/3712194c38e53e33bc5499e78e152cce.avif?t=1756025735\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect to either/both Streaming Platforms from in the game and watch your chat move through various dungeons as they pick their classes and battle enemies, level up their classes, gain new skills, and defeat the dungeon boss. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/71b9a85e12a617314403a2598940580d.avif?t=1756025735\" alt=\"8 Unique Classes!\" width=600 height=112 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/85bfd6467ef937194208dfe64aa395ab.avif?t=1756025735\" alt=\"Daring, Devious, and Dapper, this Rogue will do what it takes to win a fight. Steal from your enemies, find their weak spot, exploit it.\" width=300 height=350 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/2ae4302208f5696e2b3ccdb515056709.avif?t=1756025735\" alt=\" Pummeling enemies and shielding themselves with the power of their crystals, the Crystalsmith is a force to be reckoned with!\" width=300 height=350 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/4f366674dce84acd3f4a4548b14c5dcf.avif?t=1756025735\" alt=\"Jack of all Trades! The Alchemist can use items dropped by fallen enemies to craft a variety of potions that can bolster allies or debilitate enemies!\" width=300 height=350 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/a574d8ea0bd015d3ecf2ef7a52fa3857.avif?t=1756025735\" alt=\"The power of music brought to life! This Bard is ready to fill seats and inspire their allies, and they&#039;re all out of seats.\" width=300 height=350 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/e27be1375bce0e34d65ae8f0025ab0ea.avif?t=1756025735\" alt=\"With powerful crowd control effects, the Druid builds up energy and shapeshift into different animal forms to punish enemies and heal allies!\" width=300 height=350 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/c2b3d941f5a03e181b949d9ee7014dd4.avif?t=1756025735\" alt=\"By forming pacts with various Patrons, the Solicitor can use their power to augment his own. But what power can he really obtain?\" width=300 height=350 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/33a025d63ef01f370376077dd6f43ba8.avif?t=1756025735\" alt=\"Wield the elemental powers of the Wizard as you wreak havoc on your enemies. They will grovel at the sight of your power, if they know what&#039;s good for them.\" width=300 height=350 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/a247ed9c1682b9fa69b9896ee7ef030b.avif?t=1756025735\" alt=\"Passion and an axe come together to make the Warrior, a class that can take a beating and dish it right back. Protect your allies, taunt your enemies, swing an axe.\" width=300 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/02d0bab3966d615d0287046d325679a5.avif?t=1756025735\" width=600 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All playable classes, NPCs, and Dungeon bosses are fully voiced by an amazing cast of professional and up and coming VAs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did your favorite streamer end for the night, or raid into someone else playing Falinere Fantasy? Send a message in the next streamer's chat to have all of your data loaded in automatically so you can pick right back up where you left off and keep leveling up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Official Discord Server to stay up to date on the game, ask questions, meet the crew that are working behind the scenes, and more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1976930?t=1756025735","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756025735","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756025735","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756025735","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/extras/3712194c38e53e33bc5499e78e152cce.avif?t=1756025735\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 