d Dungeon bosses are fully voiced by an amazing cast of professional and up and coming VAs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did your favorite streamer end for the night, or raid into someone else playing Falinere Fantasy? Send a message in the next streamer's chat to have all of your data loaded in automatically so you can pick right back up where you left off and keep leveling up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Official Discord Server to stay up to date on the game, ask questions, meet the crew that are working behind the scenes, and more!</p>","developers":["Falimancy Interactive"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Twitch or Discord ","genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976930/header.jpg?t=1756025735","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1976930/1244340050/d3e32d971f87ae9f5f655067911bb7e683ec4217/1755028257/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755028711","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1976930/1244340050/d3e32d971f87ae9f5f655067911bb7e683ec4217/1755028257/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755028711","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1976930/1244340050/d3e32d971f87ae9f5f655067911bb7e683ec4217/1755028257/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755028711","id":257182272,"name":"Gameplay Trailer 2025 Playtest","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182272/cd03e315b6760430de1773a3f6fb2e14b34aa189/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755028711"}],"name":"Falinere Fantasy","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li>